'''Aspect of the Avian''' is an [[aspect]] skill that grants two [[buff]]s alternating every 4 seconds with each other with a cost of 25% mana reserved. The first buff grants you and your [[minions]] chance to deal [[double damage]], and the second buff grants increased [[movement speed]] to you and your minions. Only one aspect skill can be active at a time.

==Mechanics==
The game will track the time remaining for each buff and resume counting upon reactivation (for example, you cannot rapidly toggle the skill, remove/re-equip the gem, or cycle equipment to spend more time in one buff than allotted). 

==Acquisition==
Aspect of the Avian is found on {{il|Saqawal's Talons}} or [[beastcrafted]] onto [[rare]] equipment as an [[suffix]] ({{ml|GrantsBirdAspectCrafted}}) by using the captured [[Saqawal, First of the Sky]] unique beast. The skill can be further modified by equipping {{il|Saqawal's Winds}}, {{il|Saqawal's Nest}} or {{il|Saqawal's Flock}}. The Level 30 version of the skill is acquired from beastcrafting with the addition of [[The Black Mórrígan]]. 

The Level 35 version is only acquirable through [[Wildspeaker]]'s {{psl|Feathered Scales}} in [[Legacy of Phrecia]].

